<title>USA: Sallie Mae to redeem callable notes.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae to redeem callable notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Student Loan Marketing Association said Friday that on March 12 it will redeem the following callable notes in their entirety:</p>
<p>    Interest	Maturity	 Cusip</p>
<p>	6.925	 09/12/00     86387RSV5</p>
<p>Accrued interest of $34.625 per $1,000 face amount will be paid on March 12. The notes are worth a par amount of $50 million.</p>
<p>Sallie Mae said principal will be repaid at 100 percent of the face amount. Payment will be made to holders of record as of the close of business March 11, it said.</p>
</text>
